WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Comms → Direct messages, expand search and select a person.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Write your message. Enter sends; Shift+Enter adds a line.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.208
Step 3: Use Group chats → Create group to name a group and choose participants when permitted.

4
00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:24.208
